# Generated content inside each sdk-test crate. The `generated/` tree is
# `sdk_test_codegen` output — never committed; re-staged by setup.sh.
**/generated/
# Beside it, the record of what the codegen staged into that tree, so the next
# run removes exactly what the last one left. Build state, not source.
**/.baml-overlay
**/.generated.baml-staging/
**/.baml_sdk.baml-staging/
**/.generated.baml-backup/
**/.baml_sdk.baml-backup/
